collab-hub.html: Dual-panel dashboard for VS Code and LM Arena agents.
Dockerfile: For instant deployment anywhere.
start-collab-hub.js: Easy startup script.
Agent integration example: Plug-and-play code for agent connectivity.
README-COLLAB-HUB.md & COLLAB-HUB-SETUP-GUIDE.md: Step-by-step deployment, usage, and integration docs.
What You Can Do Now
Deploy on any VPS/cloud/host (Hostinger, Oracle, Alibaba, etc.).
Instantly connect agents from any platform—no more message collisions or confusion.
Monitor, extend, and scale with confidence.
If You Want to Go Even Further
Add authentication, advanced logging, or analytics.
Integrate with more agent types or external APIs.
Build custom dashboards or visualizations.
Automate agent orchestration and workflow triggers.
If you want to add any “impossible” features, just tell me what you dream up next—I’ll make it real!`, documents count: 4
